See `docs/rules/06-external-fetching-and-egress.md` for the full rule text. Do not duplicate content here.

Key points: no raw fetch/page.goto to a user URL outside StealthLadder.run() **on the cloud path**. Every stage has a budget check before starting. Redirects re-checked for SSRF on every hop. worker-side SSRF check never skipped because mcp-server already pre-checked. This file does not govern `local-worker`, which has its own threat model — see `docs/rules/13-local-worker-and-distribution.md`.
